{"url": "https://x.com/SawyerMerritt/status/2090179852171174211", "id": "2090179852171174211", "text": "I just set up Grok @Bot to remotely control my autonomous robot lawn mower that is 50 miles away. It literally took 2 minutes to set up.\n\nI told it to start mowing and it started 3 seconds later. Then I had it dock itself. This is so wild lol.\n\nI'm gonna set up my vacuum next, and have a Grok Bot dedicated to controlling and managing all of my autonomous robots.", "raw_text": {"text": "I just set up Grok @Bot to remotely control my autonomous robot lawn mower that is 50 miles away. It literally took 2 minutes to set up.\n\nI told it to start mowing and it started 3 seconds later. Then I had it dock itself. This is so wild lol.\n\nI'm gonna set up my vacuum next, and have a Grok Bot dedicated to controlling and managing all of my autonomous robots.", "display_text_range": [0, 364], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [19, 23], "original": "Bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [278, 301], "id": "2090179730465075200", "display": "pic.x.com/7DJ9E0wh2F", "original": "https://t.co/7DJ9E0wh2F", "replacement": "https://x.com/SawyerMerritt/status/2090179852171174211/video/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [278, 301], "id": "2090179730414682113", "display": "pic.x.com/7DJ9E0wh2F", "original": "https://t.co/7DJ9E0wh2F", "replacement": "https://x.com/SawyerMerritt/status/2090179852171174211/video/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "SawyerMerritt", "url": "https://x.com/SawyerMerritt", "id": "243013409", "followers": 1128031, "following": 492, "likes": 201182, "media_count": 23054, "name": "Sawyer Merritt", "description": "EVs/space/tech. Bringing you the latest news in a single, easy-to-read feed. $TSLA & $SPCX investor, Model Y owner.", "raw_description": {"text": "EVs/space/tech. Bringing you the latest news in a single, easy-to-read feed. $TSLA & $SPCX investor, Model Y owner.", "facets": []}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.t